-    *   If idle, check if the parent node has 8 identical-value children (including the current leaf) [S1].
-    *   If so, call `_try_coarsen_node` to merge them back into a single leaf [S1].
-5.  **Coarsening (`_try_coarsen_node`):**
-    *   Verify all 8 siblings have identical values [S1].
-    *   Remove the 8 children and promote the parent to a leaf [S1].
-    *   Return `True` if coarsened, `False` otherwise [S1].
